Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 07:10:03 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 01/29] inkling2: the two-rank CUDA engine, DSpark drafter,
 images and reply split

Carried from the gated release build by way of its near-main form: the family's own kernels and their contract registrations, the two-rank runtime with lanes, the bundled DSpark drafter, the image path and the reply and tool-call split. Lossy and timing switches come in later commits.
